{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:17.30.230","page_type":"section"},"citation":"17.30.230","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/17.30.230","content_hash":"091b9467aae3b0923d013e06b8288e106ff4a8f43df5f1f02df963db666dfefa","heading":"Recreational vehicles.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.230:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/17.30.230","text":"(a) Recreational vehicles placed on sites within all unnumbered and numbered A, AE, AH, and AO zones on the community’s FIRM shall either:\n(1) Be on the site for fewer than 180 consecutive days;\n(2) Be fully licensed and ready for highway use; or\n(3) Meet the permitting, elevation, and anchoring requirements for manufactured homes of this chapter.\n(b) A recreational vehicle is ready for highway use if it is on its wheels or jacking system, is attached to the site only by quick-disconnect type utilities and security devices, and has no permanently attached additions. (Ord. 19627 § 24, 8-23-11.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"5710d44e-3d5c-5599-9b99-f4af24de3c22"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"17.30.230","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/17.30.230","content_hash":"9c656378df94591858ac47948fc139287aa6b7c85e4393f77eca6b781da99091","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.230:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.230:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/17.30.230","text":"(a) Recreational vehicles placed on sites within all unnumbered and numbered A, AE, AH, and AO zones on the community’s FIRM shall either:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"13fcdd8b-c6f5-5126-9c8c-fbbe6581a1f6"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"17.30.230","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/17.30.230","content_hash":"d6d0917ebf18f3c7b20d31d5c800cca484da79765deb1bcdef1d230c3ee5a39b","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.230:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.230:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/17.30.230","text":"(1) Be on the site for fewer than 180 consecutive days;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"52bf9032-2134-5da7-b9b0-a24217ee9815"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"17.30.230","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/17.30.230","content_hash":"137f8b6efd8ae0d05c6d31121edb20575f48e5781998d9e4d6be86e2210c4e9a","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.230:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.230:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/17.30.230","text":"(2) Be fully licensed and ready for highway use; or","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"0d18f0df-3ebf-50c8-bc04-929745c9750f"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"17.30.230","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/17.30.230","content_hash":"d84c5050f87cff3174cdfc0adbd222f80f677c48000896c94e611323f6bd8282","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.230:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.30.230:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/17.30.230","text":"(3) Meet the permitting, elevation, and anchoring requirements for manufactured homes of this chapter.","type":"paragraph","workbench_com